{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>After the summer vacation of my third year of high school, my classmate 'Kirari Habataki' called out to me.<br>The `Kotoha Osaka' sitting next to me was wearing strange accessories.<br>And the homeroom teacher, who looks like a useless adult, says, `Komomo Mizukibashi.`<br><br>All the characters are in strange poses, but that's normal for this game. A school romance novel game set in a strange world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple types of standing pictures with strange poses are available for each heroine! Of course, all of them have multiple expression illustrations!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Players are free to choose any of the frequently appearing options! All route branching points are indicated in-game, and there is no game over. You can concentrate on communicating with the heroine.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2809960?t=1769866456","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769866456","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809960/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769866456","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809960/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769866456","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>After the summer vacation of my third year of high school, my classmate 'Kirari Habataki' called out to me.<br>The `Kotoha Osaka' sitting next to me was wearing strange accessories.<br>And the homeroom teacher, who looks like a useless adult, says, `Komomo Mizukibashi.`<br><br>All the characters are in strange poses, but that's normal for this game. A school romance novel game set in a strange world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple types of standing pictures with strange poses are available for each heroine! Of course, all of them have multiple expression illustrations!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Players are free to choose any of the frequently appearing options! All route branching points are indicated in-game, and there is no game over. You can concentrate on communicating with the heroine.</li></ul>","developers":["\u306a\u306a\u306b\u306e\u3093"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809960/header.jpg?t=1769866456","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"\u7acb\u3061\u7d75\u304c\u5909\u306a\u30dd\u30fc\u30ba\u306e\u604b\u611b\u30a2\u30c9\u30d9\u30f3\u30c1\u30e3\u30fc","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["\u306a\u306a\u306b\u306e\u3093"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809960/b35982dd5f3083fc4668b99c53087e8f42359746/ss_b35982dd5f3083fc4668b99c53087e8f42359746.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769866456","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809960/b35982dd5f3083fc4668b99c53087e8f42359746/ss_b35982dd5f3083fc4668b99c53087e8f42359746.600x338.jpg?t=1769866456"},{"id":1,"path_full":"ht